WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:03.800
Meet Salto.

00:00:03.960 --> 00:00:07.240
Arguably, the world’s most agile jumping robot.

00:00:07.250 --> 00:00:10.849
Its creators looked all over the animal kingdom for inspiration.

00:00:10.849 --> 00:00:13.689
Salto’s legs bend like a bush baby’s—

00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:15.920
a small primate that appears to have the greatest

00:00:16.349 --> 00:00:18.820
jumping agility of all.

00:00:18.820 --> 00:00:21.820
Salto has a tail like the leaping Agama lizard.

00:00:21.820 --> 00:00:23.720
To control direction.

00:00:23.980 --> 00:00:26.320
The designers even took a few tips from humans

00:00:26.320 --> 00:00:28.320
and video game characters.

00:00:28.570 --> 00:00:31.830
In real life parkour and many virtual games,

00:00:31.830 --> 00:00:34.810
players run and bounce off walls to propel

00:00:35.010 --> 00:00:37.500
themselves higher than their legs ever could.

00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:39.339
That’s Salto’s best trick.

00:00:39.339 --> 00:00:40.619
It’s called the wall-jump.

00:00:40.920 --> 00:00:43.420
First, the robot crouches,

00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:45.700
then launches itself toward the wall,

00:00:45.800 --> 00:00:48.020
reorients mid leap

00:00:48.220 --> 00:00:49.840
and then jumps again

00:00:49.840 --> 00:00:52.180
Reaching a height greater than it could

00:00:52.180 --> 00:00:54.180
with a single jump

00:00:55.199 --> 00:00:59.239
That initial crouch is what makes or breaks the jump.

00:00:59.239 --> 00:01:02.030
Salto’s crouch is more like a super-crouch.

00:01:02.030 --> 00:01:07.710
The robot stays low just long enough to build up energy

00:01:07.960 --> 00:01:10.860
and uses it to explode off the ground.

00:01:10.980 --> 00:01:15.640
Charging up before launch is called “power modulation.”

00:01:15.640 --> 00:01:19.460
Animals that can do it store the built-up energy in their tendons.

00:01:19.460 --> 00:01:22.860
Salto stores it in a spring.

00:01:23.340 --> 00:01:27.560
In bush babies, this makes their jumps 15 times more powerful

00:01:27.560 --> 00:01:30.380
than if they used muscular action alone.

00:01:30.380 --> 00:01:34.970
But, despite their efforts, Salto can’t best the bush baby.

00:01:34.970 --> 00:01:39.110
Its jumps are 22% less powerful than the cuddly
creature’s.

00:01:39.380 --> 00:01:41.340
Even still, this is a giant leap for robot-kind.

